WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.688
The first major question is how the dataset is
organized Structured

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:11.467
data follows a predefined schema Semi-structured
data has named fields but allows

00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:17.559
flexibility and nesting Unstructured data does not
naturally arrive as rows and columns

00:00:19.287 --> 00:00:24.837
These categories describe organization A structured
table can still

00:00:24.851 --> 00:00:30.787
have missing values duplicate records or poorly
defined variables Organization

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:32.643
and quality are separate issues
